<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CNA to sell interests to Wooltru.</title>
<headline>CNA to sell interests to Wooltru.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading South African retailer CNA Gallo Ltd said on Thursday it had reached agreement in principle to dispose of all its interests in Central News Agency Ltd and Constantia Greetings (Pty) Ltd to Wooltru Ltd.  </p>
<p>The announcement comes after earlier cautionaries which said CNA Gallo was considering a restructuring.</p>
<p>CNA advised shareholders to continue to exercise caution in their dealings until a further announcement is made, which is expected to be on or about August 29.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
